 Installing and Configuring Grafana
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Install Grafana on a Linux server using package management
Configure Grafana for initial setup and security
Access the Grafana web interface and navigate the dashboard
Connect Grafana to a local data source (Prometheus)
Create basic visualizations and understand Grafana's core functionality
Troubleshoot common installation and configuration issues
